scribed, budget-complete training members in canonical order; no dropping, replacement, imputation, score-seeking retries or work extensions.\",\n    \"At least three SAME original members jointly satisfy authentic actual-own-initial strict improvement and every task signal/reference predicate.\",\n    \"All five outcomes, including finite below-bar/non-improving members, remain in the unchanged whole-five historical quality statistic.\",\n    \"Original served index0 independently satisfies its own exact learning/reference and unchanged external/historical bar restrictions; no outcome-selected serving index.\",\n    \"Exact admitted served bytes, original source/device provenance, authentic replay, completion, Store and lane admission remain mandatory.\",\n    \"Historical calibrated-floor provenance remains explicitly limited; finite canonical learning does not claim population probability or published-model parity.\",\n    \"All11 supervised recipes keep canonical base+[0..4], exact per-seed epochs/examples/batches/updates, unchanged held-out labels/targets and paired initial/final predictions.\",\n    \"Classification retains exact finite uniform/majority signal restrictions and strict own-initial gain; regression retains strict own-initial gain and both prescribed constant predictors.\"\n  ],\n  \"tuning_scope\": \"The remaining tuning row retains seed1729/trials128 and its existing optimization contract; these scopes do not convert it into a five-seed native/supervised learning claim.\",\n  \"compatibility_review\": {\n    \"file\": {\n      \"path\": \".build/phase278-current/reviews/compatibility/576d37311199cb3be896b8511c0e049ea5dc784533976f6c9c386f22a5c28ee1/prospective-correctness-criterion-compatibility.json\",\n      \"bytes\": 99831,\n      \"sha256\": \"aa5242b04fbfb57b792ad6b7fed411d942108de98d795566c982e69c95880d59\"\n    },\n    \"role\": \"Fresh successor source-bound compatibility note. Earlier notes and unadopted c5 drafts remain literal histori