714750528\n        },\n        {\n          \"n\": 1000,\n          \"classes\": 100,\n          \"minimum\": 24,\n          \"tail_at_minimum\": 0.00010908385071228082,\n          \"tail_below_minimum\": 0.0002721563481729341\n        },\n        {\n          \"n\": 1000,\n          \"classes\": 200,\n          \"minimum\": 16,\n          \"tail_at_minimum\": 6.515582032004274e-05,\n          \"tail_below_minimum\": 0.00021580336348481794\n        }\n      ],\n      \"majority_control\": \"Largest actual held-out class count plus1 is an additional lower bound; actual final correct count must strictly exceed its own initial count.\",\n      \"cohort_null_bound\": \"Under the specified all-five within-seed iid uniform-per-example null, E[S]<=5/5000 and Markov gives P(S>=3)<=1/3000 without seed independence. At most30 fixed cohorts have union bound0.01. No mixed-null, adaptive-retry, arbitrary neural-network or population claim follows.\"\n    },\n    \"regression\": \"On the fixed finite binary64 target vector, exact SSE(c)=sum((y-mean(y))^2)+n*(c-mean(y))^2. Strictly beating the held-out best constant establishes finite held-out skill only. Strict paired own-initial SSE improvement and the prescribed training-mean control remain; no population inference.\",\n    \"native\": \"Paired exact initial/final task schedules, every fixed controller, actually proved maximum-only reference equality and strict own-initial gain remain distinct requirements. Finite failed seeds remain in all-five quality; no return, HER, arena or ARS provenance is supplied by mathematical comparison alone.\",\n    \"historical_floors\": \"Historical bars remain additional actual project-calibrated restrictions, including Tiny0.008 after0.012; they are not external published-model results. Historical California/PPO-MountainCar/A2C-Lunar/TRPO-MountainCar failures retain their original outcomes and no persistence-fix causal improvement is claimed.\",\n    \"tuning\": \"The separate seed1729/trials128 contract remains; it is not converted into a five-seed learning claim.\"\n  },\n  \"scope_decisions\": [\n    {\n      \"lane\": \"linux-cpu\",\n      \"scope\": \"supervised\",\n      \"draft\": {\n        \"path\": \".build/phase278-current/reviews/prospective/576d37311199cb3be896b8511c0e049ea5dc784533976f6c9c386f22a5c28ee1/linux-cpu-supervised-judgment.json\",\n        \"bytes\": 140331,\n        \"sha256\": \"79a606d0892112d3f763e0cc1e926fab0b717b5216e4cd58721710011e1bbc2a\"\n      },\n      \"decision\": \"APPROVE_PROSPECTIVE_CURRENT_SOURCE_UNCHANGED_FINITE_CRITERION\",\n      \"basis\": \"All11 supervised cohorts retain their exact original complete five-member schedules, strict actual paired own-initial improvement, classification uniform/majority or both regression constant controls, at least3 SAME joint successes, unchanged whole-five quality and independently eligible served0.\",\n      \"qualification_claim\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"lane\": \"linux-cpu\",\n      \"scope\": \"native\",\n      \"draft\": {\n        \"path\": \".build/phase278-current/reviews/prospective/576d37311199cb3be896b8511c0e049ea5dc784533976f6c9c386f22a5c28ee1/linux-cpu-native-judgment.json\",\n        \"bytes\": 142157,\n        \"sha256\": \"f6f930f6dd8d15f8e193feb54a35ca3c543546fd15f16ce4faf3a106141ee873\"\n      },\n      \"decision\": \"APPROVE_PROSPECTIVE_CURRENT_SOURCE_UNCHANGED_FINITE_CRITERION\",\n      \"basis\": \"All43 native cohorts retain seeds42..46 and original physical work:38 return,1 HER and4 arena. At least3 SAME original members must jointly improve strictly over actual own initial and pass fixed task references; equality is limited to actually attained independently proved maxima. Whole-five quality and independently eligible original served0 remain additional requirements. ARS host-linear/applied-step disclosure and both-role arena/goal HER restrictions remain.\",\n      \"qualification_claim\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"lane\": \"apple-silicon\",