     \"lane\": \"linux-cpu\",\n      \"scope\": \"supervised\",\n      \"decision\": \"APPROVE_PROSPECTIVE_CURRENT_SOURCE_UNCHANGED_FINITE_CRITERION\",\n      \"draft_judgment\": {\n        \"path\": \".build/phase278-current/reviews/prospective/576d37311199cb3be896b8511c0e049ea5dc784533976f6c9c386f22a5c28ee1/linux-cpu-supervised-judgment.json\",\n        \"bytes\": 140331,\n        \"sha256\": \"79a606d0892112d3f763e0cc1e926fab0b717b5216e4cd58721710011e1bbc2a\"\n      },\n      \"full55_contract_set_sha256\": \"555aa3ad727fec53c2e2b361df5f8f10e6c89875c89ed4ca7d1f2cbdc9331b2c\",\n      \"full55_rows\": 55,\n      \"scientific_rows\": 11,\n      \"criterion_basis\": [\n        \"I approve prospective applicability of the unchanged finite supervised-learning conjunction to these eleven actual source-bound rows. I joined all55 tuples and the eleven-row prefix to the actual compiled public export and verified the complete lane contract digest independently.\",\n        \"Canonical SL base seeds1001+i with offsets0..4, held-out partition/labels/targets, per-member work, paired initial/final observations, binary64 quality floors and original served0 remain unchanged. All eleven policy inputs and every scientific provider changed by this successor delta are unchanged: the new source edits concern PV projection and its real regression fixture only.\",\n        \"I recomputed exact iid uniform-per-example binomial upper-tail critical counts for1000 observations at alpha1/5000:10classes\u2192136,100\u219224,200\u219216. The actual held-out largest-class count plus one can strengthen this floor. Strict own-initial gain remains additional. These are conditional finite null calculations, not arbitrary-model or population confidence.\",\n        \"For regression, the exact decomposition SSE(c)=SSE(mean)+n*(c-mean)^2 supports comparison to the best constant; the prescribed train-mean and held-out best-constant comparisons and authentic strict own-initial improvement remain conjunctive. No regression probability theorem is claimed.\",\n        \"With no between-seed independence assumed, the all-five applicable iid-uniform nulls imply E[S]\u22645/5000 and P(S\u22653)\u22641/3000; a union over at most30 prospectively allocated classification cohorts is\u22640.01. This does not cover mixed nulls, arbitrary learned models, adaptive retries, native or regression outcomes.\"\n      ],\n      \"current_source_qualified_outcomes\": 0,\n      \"qualification_claim\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"lane\": \"linux-cpu\",\n      \"scope\": \"native\",\n      \"decision\": \"APPROVE_PROSPECTIVE_CURRENT_SOURCE_UNCHANGED_FINITE_CRITERION\",\n      \"draft_judgment\": {\n        \"path\": \".build/phase278-current/reviews/prospective/576d37311199cb3be896b8511c0e049ea5dc784533976f6c9c386f22a5c28ee1/linux-cpu-native-judgment.json\",\n        \"bytes\": 142157,\n        \"sha256\": \"f6f930f6dd8d15f8e193feb54a35ca3c543546fd15f16ce4faf3a106141ee873\"\n      },\n      \"full55_contract_set_sha256\": \"555aa3ad727fec53c2e2b361df5f8f10e6c89875c89ed4ca7d1f2cbdc9331b2c\",\n      \"full55_rows\": 55,\n      \"scientific_rows\": 43,\n      \"criterion_basis\": [\n        \"I approve prospective applicability of the unchanged finite native-learning conjunction to these43 actual source-bound rows:38 RETURN,1 HER and4 arena. I joined the ordered43-row subset and complete55 tuple vector to the actual compiled public export and independently verified the full lane contract digest.\",\n        \"Canonical five original seeds42..46, full prescribed transitions/episodes/evaluations/minibatches/updates, trainer/evaluator/reference identities and budget/origin restrictions remain unchanged. The successor605 delta touches no scientific trainer, evaluator, reference, optimizer, recipe or qualification arithmetic.\",\n        \"Strict authentic effective-own-initial gain remains required jointly with every applicable fixed reference on at least three SAME original members, plus unchanged whole-five quality and independently eligible original served0. Inherited SAC warm-prepared effective initial state and ARS host Double/applied-step provenance remain exact producer obligations.\",\n        \"Equality to references is allowed only where the actual independently supported structural maximum is attained: supported complete KeyDoor state/time ceiling, HER20success with exact0distance, and exact arena9-win score1. Unsupported, unattained or below-maximum reference cases remain strict. Strict own-initial gain never becomes equality.\",\n        \"Arena evaluation retains both roles and its policy-independent opponent/tape definitions. HER retains exact goal/success/distance predicates. A numerical fixture, compact proxy or generic backend test cannot stand in for these authentic per-family original-work and served replay witnesses. No universal convergence or population-success probability is claimed.\"\n      ],\n      \"current_source_qualified_outcomes\": 0,\n      \"qualification_claim\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"lane\": \"apple-silicon\",\n      \"scope\": \"supervised\",\n      \"decision\": \"APPROVE_PROSPECTIVE_CURRENT_SOURCE_UNCHANGED_FINITE_CRITERION\",\n      \"draft_judgment\": {\n        \"path\": \".build/phase278-current/reviews/prospective/576d37311199cb3be896b8511c0e049ea5dc784533976f6c9c386f22a5c28ee1/apple-silicon-supervised-judgment.json\",\n        \"bytes\": 140403,\n        \"sha256\": \"fd6d9de2ac103aa2169f731182ba03742071bf559baaf768aa4d781f7c8119e1\"\n      },\n      \"full55_contract_set_sha256\": \"2d256900ff740e5ec6b392d1a60c9d36813b4147b9fba0a4a49a46dcb73b53f3\",\n      \"full55_rows\": 55,\n      \"scientific_rows\": 11,\n      \"criterion_basis\": [\n        \"I approve prospective applicability of the unchanged finite supervised-learning conjunction to these eleven actual source-bound rows. I joined all55 tuples and the eleven-row prefix to the actual compiled public export and verified the complete lane contract digest independently.\",\n        \"Canonical SL base seeds1001+i with offsets0..4, held-out partition/labels/targets, per-member work, paired initial/final observations, binary64 quality floors and original served0 remain unchanged. All eleven policy inputs and every scientific provider changed by this successor delta are unchanged: the new source edits concern PV projection and its real regression fixture only.\",\n        \"I recomputed exact iid uniform-per-example binomial upper-tail critical counts for1000 observations at alpha1/5000:10classes\u2192136,100\u219224,200\u219216. The actual held-out largest-class count plus one can strengthen this floor. Strict own-initial gain remains additional. These are conditional finite null calculations, not arbitrary-model or population confidence.\",\n        \"For regression, the exact decomposition SSE(c)=SSE(mean)+n*(c-mean)^2 supports comparison to the best constant; the prescribed train-mean and held-out best-constant comparisons and authentic strict own-initial improvement remain conjunctive. No regression probability theorem is claimed.\",\n        \"With no between-seed independence assumed, the all-five applicable iid-uniform nulls imply E[S]\u22645/5000 and P(S\u22653)\u22641/3000; a union over at most30 prospectively allocated classification cohorts is\u22640.01. This does not cover mixed nulls, arbitrary learned models, adaptive retries, native or regression outcomes.\"\n      ],\n      \"current_source_qualified_outcomes\": 0,\n      \"qualification_claim\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"lane\": \"apple-silicon\",\n      \"scope\": \"native\",\n      \"decision\": \"APPROVE_PROSPECTIVE_CURRENT_SOURCE_UNCHANGED_FINITE_CRITERION\",\n      \"draft_judgment\": {\n        \"path\": \".build/phase278-current/reviews/prospective/576d37311199cb3be896b8511c0e049ea5dc784533976f6c9c386f22a5c28ee1/apple-silicon-native-judgment.json\",\n        \"bytes\": 148277,\n        \"sha256\": \"4ddeb121935ac2a543ec3667244fc68c512fc270e595e9c3f1227f4a6ceef635\"\n      },\n      \"full55_contract_set_sha256\": \"2d256900ff740e5ec6b392d1a60c9d36813b4147b9fba0a4a49a46dcb73b53f3\",\n      \"full55_rows\": 55,\n      \"scientific_rows\": 43,\n      \"criterion_basis\": [\n        \"I approve prospective applicability of the unchanged finite native-learning conjunction to these43 actual source-bound rows:38 RETURN,1 HER and4 arena. I joined the ordered43-row subset and complete55 tuple vector to the actual compiled public export and independently verified the full lane contract digest.\",\n        \"Canonical five original seeds42..46, full prescribed transitions/episodes/evaluations/minibatches/updates, trainer/evaluator/reference identities and budget/origin restrictions remain unchanged. The successor605 delta touches no scientific trainer, evaluator, reference, optimizer, recipe or qualification arithmetic.\",\n        \"Strict authentic effective-own-initial gain remains required jointly with every applicable fixed reference on at least three SAME original members, plus unchanged whole-five quality and independently eligible original served0. Inherited SAC warm-prepared effective initial state and ARS host Double/applied-step provenance remain exact producer obligations.\",\n        \"Equality to references is allowed only where the actual independently supported structural maximum is attained: supported complete KeyDoor state/time ceiling, HER20success with exact0distance, and exact arena9-win score1. Unsupported, unattained or below-maximum reference cases remain strict. Strict own-initial gain never becomes equality.\",\n        \"Arena evaluation retains both roles and its policy-independent opponent/tape definitions. HER retains exact goal/success/distance predicates. A numerical fixture, compact proxy or generic backend test cannot stand in for these authentic per-family original-work and served replay witnesses. No universal convergence or population-success probability is claimed.\"\n      ],\n      \"current_source_qualified_outcomes\": 0,\n      \"qualification_claim\": false\n    }\n  ],\n  \"binding_common_restrictions\": [\n    \"Exactly five original prescribed members execute their entire canonical physical budget in canonical order. Every started, incomplete, failed, finite below-bar or non-improving attempt remains retained. No outcome-driven replacements, dropping, imputation, retry namespace, splicing or extension of budget is authorized.\",\n    \"At least three SAME original members jointly meet authentic strict effective-own-initial improvement AND every applicable task/reference predicate. Separate three-of-five counts cannot be combined.\",\n    \"Every original member remains in the unchanged whole-five historical quality statistic; original serving index0 independently remains eligible against its own predicates and unchanged quality restrictions. No score-selected serving member is authorized.\",\n    \"Actual admitted served bytes, complete source-bound journals, producer/device witnesses, replay, completion, Store and current lane admission remain independently necessary. The review DATA cannot create any of those capabilities.\",\n    \"The retained Tiny0.008 floor follows historical0.012 and is a calibrated project restriction, not an externally independent convergence benchmark. Historical evidence and all prior failed image, unit, lifecycle and preservation attempts stay literal and are not converted into current passes.\",\n    \"One separate tuning row keeps its canonical seed1729 and target128. Tuning is neither one of the eleven SL nor one of the forty-three native scientific cohort rows.\"\n  ],\n  \"implementation_scope_findings\": [\n    \"The genuine old-producer red ran every29 fixture command successfully, passed production archive/extract and sameRestoredTree, then failed at the intended postprojection metadata assertion. GNU chmod retained directory SGID but widened mode02751\u219202777 and access ACL mask/other bits. This is direct source-specific evidence of the addressed defect, without alleging observed loss on the old real default02777 PV roots.\",\n    \"The new producer uses successful exclusive backing-leaf mkdir as its only default chmod/chown initialization authority. Existing empty, nonempty and restored physical-directory metadata is preserved; trailing separators are stripped before final-component symlink checks, file/symlink aliases refuse, and every projected target must identify the same live device/inode as its backing root. A wrong preexisting bind is refused without replacing it.\",\n    \"The real Linux fixture executes the exact production rendered body in isolated owned containers/volumes and checks metadata/payload after projection and repetition, fresh initialization, an existing empty restrictive root, and file/symlink/wrong-bind refusals. Final five-case0 and renderer case0 support this focused repair; they are not a substitute for current-source daemon, full lifecycle, lane or model-work gates.\",\n    \"The existing CUDA legacy-PG arm was not broadened. The new test is wired to the existing real daemon lifecycle stanza. No numeric acceptance policy, model/config, dataset split, reference, optimizer, seed count, budget or admission API changed in this successor.\"\n  ],\n  \"implementation_evidence\": {\n    \"actual_red_and_applied_source_independent_review\": {\n      \"path\": \".build/phase278-current/reviews/projection-actual-red-applied-fix-independent-20261024.json\",\n      \"bytes\": 42503,\n      \"sha256\": \"bbe9a9260cb5652528c51ccbb649e8a359516fe4d2a2027dc9d9fc0f7f78b7bc\"\n    },\n    \"final_focused_green_independent_review\": {\n      \"path\": \".build/phase278-current/reviews/projection-final-focused-green-independent-20261024.json\",\n      \"bytes\": 15062,\n      \"sha256\": \"4e3e331a084897107da220ca250d4f92edf17ac8d45b4f3be1ee5fcf65b94109\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"provenance_assessment\": [\n    \"I independently audited the actual supported native build, selected-package-ID helper compile and public export chain. Exact executable driver/entry argv, source/helper bytes, actual current native plan/database/library pins and actual stdout joins establish the ordinary DATA export from the reviewed source.\",\n    \"The guard window closed at16:31:09Z before the later legitimate native gates. Recorded actual checks attest that window. Later native tests changed cache files as expected; I do not assert that every recorded cache pin still equals its old state after those later gates. Noncache inputs and immutable helper/export bytes were independently checked.\",\n    \"Actual build/compile/export0 and all110 unchanged contracts establish their stated ordinary source/DATA facts. They do not mint reviewer independence, hardware learning, admission, completion, Store or authentic model execution capabilities.\"\n  ],\n  \"helper_chain_independent_review\": {\n    \"path\": \".build/phase278-current/reviews/native-successor-helper-actual-chain-independent-20261024.json\",\n    \"bytes\": 18336,\n    \"sha256\": \"fcaab4c093271eef6218ba03a3f6792b223a0ddcb6377247cdaeac7fae9b1a6d\"\n  },\n  \"helper_chain_cache_count_clarification\": {\n    \"path\": \".build/phase278-current/reviews/native-successor-helper-actual-chain-cache-count-clarification-20261024.json\",\n    \"bytes\": 995,\n    \"sha256\": \"35b5aaadbe3d471504eabec95012c7aebd0e1f72f25e641653aabf921f7f3832\"\n  },\n  \"public_export\": {\n    \"path\": \".build/phase278-current/source-contract-export-pv-projection-fix-20261024/stdout\",\n    \"bytes\": 21726,\n    \"sha256\": \"e92449d02c657fc7f49f305db3d24ca0d02422b4598ad125f50a3a19eb16e38e\"\n  },\n  \"public_export_receipt\": {\n    \"path\": \".build/phase278-current/source-contract-export-pv-projection-fix-20261024/receipt.json\",\n    \"bytes\": 2644,\n    \"sha256\": \"5073455f27a82ca674e25afa9c68092ad788dd34ca7b0e549d6778450d82fc6e\"\n  },\n  \"native_build_receipt\": {\n    \"