exist for these52 targets at this assessment point.\"\n  ],\n  \"validation_scope\": {\n    \"review_reads_only\": \"Retained files and source text; byte hashing/JSON/integer arithmetic; no project runtime, compiler, Cabal, Docker, cluster or network call.\",\n    \"new_qualifying_training_runs\": 0,\n    \"new_source_qualified_outcomes\": 0,\n    \"canonical_or_governed_edits_by_this_assessment\": false,\n    \"materialization_or_registration_performed\": false,\n    \"private_authority_constructors_used\": false,\n    \"new_hardware_or_admitted_execution_claim\": false,\n    \"full_current_daemon_lifecycle_or_normal_cycle_claim\": false,\n    \"phase_completion_claim\": false\n  },\n  \"limitations\": [\n    \"Approval is limited to prospective scientific applicability of the fixed criterion for these exact source/row/scope bindings; future source changes require appropriate fresh review and gates.\",\n    \"Actual source-bound image/build/check-code and lane gates, genuine Ready/full dataset verification, full normal lifecycle/fault/component/daemon obligations, prescribed full five-member original work in both lanes, authentic qualification/served replay and reviewed admission remain separate obligations.\",\n    \"Historical calibrated floors are project restrictions with explicit provenance. Conditional exact classification math does not imply population accuracy, arbitrary neural-model confidence, mixed-null guarantees, regression/native confidence or published-model parity.\",\n    \"The completed focused fixture and renderer tests cover the specific repaired projection semantics. They do not prove every platform or malicious concurrent path race. Existing ordinary serialized workspace/path assumptions remain.\",\n    \"My implementation authorship and shared automated-agent environment limit independence as disclosed. No human signoff is asserted.\"\n  ],\n  \"canonical_materialization_performed\": false\n}\n",
